# Imports

## Prefer these surfaces

| Need | Import |
| --- | --- |
| UI components | `@stream-kit/ui/<component>` subpaths (e.g. `@stream-kit/ui/button`) |
| Plugin types | `import type { … } from '@stream-kit/plugin'` |
| Shared runtime helpers | `@stream-kit/core` |
| App internals (app package only) | `$lib/core/…`, `$lib/components/core/…` |

## Avoid

- Deep relative imports into `packages/ui/src/…` from app/plugins — use package subpath exports.
- Importing `@stream-kit/ui` for declarative plugin menu pages — define page schemas via `@stream-kit/plugin`; the app renders them.
- Bundling host packages into plugin dist (see `plugin-architecture.mdc`).

## App core barrels

When adding a public app-core surface, re-export from the relevant `packages/app/src/lib/core/*/index.ts` so consumers can import from the package area consistently.
